 "etapas": [
  {
   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Replace the noun",
     "texto": [
      "To avoid repeating a noun, use **lo, la, los, las**. They go **before the verb** and match what they replace in gender and number.\n\n- el pan → **lo** compro.\n- la casa → **la** veo.\n- los libros → **los** busco.\n- las llaves → **las** tengo.\n\nWith a person, **a** goes before the name: veo **a** Ana. With the pronoun, the **a** disappears: **la** veo.\n\nIf you start the sentence with the object, you repeat the pronoun: **las llaves las** tengo yo."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "gramatica",
     "titulo": "Lo, la, los or las: which one to choose",
     "texto": [
      "Choose according to what you replace:\n\n- **masculine singular**: el libro → **lo**\n- **feminine singular**: la casa → **la**\n- **masculine plural**: los libros → **los**\n- **feminine plural**: las llaves → **las**\n\nThe pronoun goes **before** the conjugated verb: **lo** veo, and with a negative **no lo** veo.\n\nThey also work for people: veo a Pablo → **lo** veo; veo a Ana → **la** veo."
     ],
